  candidateSeats: []
  walkSpeed: 0
  turnSpeed: 6.5
  humanoid: {fileID: 1870064252}
  citizenName: "H\xFCseyin Abi"
  citizenRole: "Selman Bakkal & Manav \xB7 No:58"
  vendorShopId: shop_bakkal
  isBrave: 1
  chatLines:
  - "Ho\u015F geldin kom\u015Fu! D\u0131\u015Far\u0131daki manavdan taze meyve, arkadaki
    \u015Fark\xFCteriden peynir-sucuk, dolaptan dondurma alabilirsin!"
  - "Aziziye Caddesi'ndeki \u0130TO \u015Eehit Er Dursun S\u0131vaz \u0130lkokulu
    da\u011F\u0131l\u0131nca b\xFCt\xFCn \xE7ocuklar dondurma dolab\u0131n\u0131n
    ba\u015F\u0131na \xFC\u015F\xFC\u015F\xFCr."
  - "Hamidiye Muhtarl\u0131\u011F\u0131'ndan Z\xFCbeyde Han\u0131m Caddesi'ne kadar
    herkes Selman Bakkal & Manav'\u0131 bilir!"
  - "\u0130stersen kasa band\u0131na gel, istersen do\u011Frudan reyonlardan al\u0131\u015Fveri\u015F
    yap kom\u015Fu."
